WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.544
Macchiarini was a superstar surgeon.

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:05.046
He’s this good-looking man of mystery.

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:05.964
A miracle worker.

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:07.632
His technique was groundbreaking.

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:09.175
The artificial trachea

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:10.510
for people who have problems

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.594
with their windpipe.

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:13.221
But the problem is...

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.598
Paolo’s surgeries are failing.

00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:18.643
Paolo was selling a miracle.

00:00:18.643 --> 00:00:20.103
People want to believe in a miracle.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.314
But something is off.

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:25.650
He was just so desperate to

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.610
show this idea could work.

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.071
And that had deadly consequences.

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:34.075
Patient is developing all sorts of complications.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:37.120
Paolo’s synthetic trachea clogs up.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.955
The feeling that you’re about to suffocate

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:39.581
all the time.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.501
It was medical torture.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.255
He lied consistently throughout his career

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:48.506
about his credentials.

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:50.842
Paolo was fooling everybody

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:52.343
professionally and personally.

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:54.095
Macchiarini lied about

00:00:54.095 --> 00:00:56.097
the success of the patients.

00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:57.974
While Paolo’s patients were dying,

00:00:58.516 --> 00:01:00.643
there were patients being actively recruited

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:01.770
and operated on.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.063
He had to be stopped.

00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:05.148
For me the question has always been...

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:08.401
How did he get away with it

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:09.861
for as long as he did?

